LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of SOLFALL Launcher is already installed! It is not recommended that you install an older version. If you really want to install this older version, it's better to uninstall the current version first. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of SOLFALL Launcher is installed on your system. It's recommended that you uninstall the current version before installing. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
